# Calendar Configuration
# To display calendar events, add your Outlook calendar ICS feed URL
# How to get the URL:
# 1. Open your Outlook calendar
# 2. Click Calendar > Share
# 3. Click "Publish Calendar"
# 4. Copy the ICS URL
# 5. Paste it below (remove the # to uncomment)

# NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDAR_ICS_URL=https://outlook.office365.com/owa/calendar/your-calendar-id/calendar.ics
